null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124198","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124198","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124198.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124198.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #124085\r\n\r\nOn Windows, the window icon disappeared after switching from fullscreen or exclusive fullscreen to windowed mode.\r\n\r\nThis issue was solved by reapply the window icon after changing the native window style. Since the code for setting the icon was duplicated, it was extracted into a helper method.\r\n\r\nThe fix is tested on Windows with a project starting in fullscreen and switching to windowed mode. The first image shows the result before the change, and the second shows the result after the change.\r\n[\r\n<img width=\"421\" height=\"126\" alt=\"no-icon\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94a0c67a-10b0-4473-a678-360fa015e33c\" />\r\n<img width=\"415\" height=\"176\" alt=\"icon visible\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/668fbb83-2537-489d-ba3f-bef1d4bcadc8\" />\r\n](url)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nAI was used to explain the issue and help identify the relevant file for the fix.\r\n\r\nThis is my first PR to Godot so feedback is appreciated!\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124198/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124198/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}